<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=5.0"><title>Earn It — Hitting Snapshot | Paxton Wilson</title><style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{font-family:'Poppins',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#000000;color:#FFFFFF;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
.hdr{padding:20px 16px 14px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #222222;}.hdr .l{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;}.hdr .l img{height:32px;}.hdr h1{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;}.hdr .sub{font-size:11px;color:#888888;margin-top:2px;}
.pn{text-align:center;padding:14px 16px 4px;}.pn h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;}.pn .dt{font-size:13px;color:#888888;margin-top:2px;}.pn .bd{display:inline-block;background:#444444;padding:3px 14px;border-radius:14px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px;letter-spacing:.5px;}
.sec{padding:10px 12px;max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;}.st{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#888888;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.mg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;}.mc{background:#111111;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #222222;}
.mc_top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;}.mc_lbl{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;color:#888888;}.mc_unit{font-size:8px;color:#888888;opacity:.5;}
.mc_vals{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;}.mc_v{text-align:center;flex:1;}.mc_num{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;}.mc_v.tgt .mc_num{font-size:18px;color:#00C853;}.mc_sub{font-size:8px;color:#888888;opacity:.5;display:block;margin-top:-1px;}
.mc_bar{height:4px;background:#222222;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:3px;}.mc_fill{height:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:2px;}
.mc_goal_desc{font-size:9px;color:#00C853;margin-bottom:4px;opacity:0.8;line-height:1.3;}
.mc_desc{font-size:8px;color:#888888;opacity:0.5;line-height:1.3;}
.goal_card{background:#111111;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #222222;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;}
.goal_icon{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:6px;}.goal_main{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;}.goal_sub{font-size:11px;color:#888888;margin-bottom:10px;}
.goal_bar{height:6px;background:#222222;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:10px;max-width:280px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}.goal_fill{height:100%;background:#00C853;border-radius:3px;}
.goal_milestones{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;}.gm{display:inline-block;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#222222;color:#888888;font-weight:600;}.gm.active{background:#444444;color:#FFFFFF;}.gm_label{color:#888888;opacity:0.4;font-size:9px;margin-left:4px;}
.sixmo_card{background:#111111;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #222222;margin-bottom:10px;}
.sixmo_icon{font-size:24px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px;}
.sixmo_main{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px;}
.sixmo_tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;}
.sixmo_tbl th{color:#888888;opacity:0.6;font-weight:600;text-align:right;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #222222;}
.sixmo_tbl th:first-child{text-align:left;}
.sixmo_tbl td{text-align:right;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #222222;}
.sixmo_tbl td:first-child{text-align:left;font-weight:600;color:#888888;}
.sixmo_tbl .gain{color:#00C853;font-weight:700;}
.sixmo_tbl .ga{color:#00C853;font-weight:700;}
.sixmo_tbl .rd{color:#FF5252;font-weight:700;}
.sixmo_sub{font-size:10px;text-align:center;color:#888888;opacity:0.6;margin-bottom:8px;}
.sixmo_note{font-size:9px;color:#888888;opacity:0.5;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;}
.pct{background:#111111;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #222222;}.pr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #222222;font-size:13px;}.pr:last-child{border:none;}
.pr_lbl{width:80px;font-weight:600;font-size:12px;}.pr_bar{flex:1;height:8px;background:#222222;border-radius:4px;}.pr_fill{height:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:4px;}.pr_val{width:36px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;}
.recs{background:#111111;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 12px 12px 28px;border:1px solid #222222;}.recs li{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:6px;color:#888888;}.recs li::marker{color:#FFFFFF;}
.ft{text-align:center;padding:18px 14px;font-size:9px;color:#888888;opacity:0.4;letter-spacing:.5px;}
</style></head><body>
<div class="hdr"><div class="l"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="The Cage"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Earn It Academy"></div><h1>Hitting Snapshot</h1><div class="sub">Earn It Academy · The Cage</div></div>
<div class="pn"><h2>Paxton Wilson</h2><div class="dt">12 years old · 12U · Last: 2026-08-28</div><div class="bd">42 sessions · 620 batted balls</div></div>

<div class="goal_card">
<div class="goal_icon">🎯</div>
<div class="goal_main">Monthly Goal: <strong>78.8 mph</strong> peak exit velo</div>
<div class="goal_sub">76.5 mph now → 78.8 mph in 2 months (at 1.5%/mo)</div>
<div class="goal_bar"><div class="goal_fill" style="width:92%"></div></div>
<div class="goal_milestones">
  <span class="gm active">44</span>
  <span class="gm active">54</span>
  <span class="gm active">68</span>
  <span class="gm_label">Age group reference · 12U</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="sixmo_card">
<div class="sixmo_icon">📈</div>
<div class="sixmo_main">6-Month Improvement</div>
<div class="sixmo_sub">Average of last 4 sessions vs 4 sessions ~6 months ago</div>
<table class="sixmo_tbl">
  <tr><th></th><th>6 Months Ago</th><th>Now</th><th>Change</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Peak EV</td><td>71.5 mph</td><td>74.5 mph</td><td class="ga">+3.0 mph</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Avg EV</td><td>60.6 mph</td><td>63.9 mph</td><td class="ga">+3.3 mph</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Avg Dist</td><td>211.3 ft</td><td>234.6 ft</td><td class="ga">+23.3 ft</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="sixmo_note">Real improvement — not projected. Based on actual Cage session data.</div>
</div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">Batted Ball Metrics</div><div class="mg"><div class="mc"><div class="mc_top"><span class="mc_lbl">Avg Exit Vel.</span><span class="mc_unit">mph</span></div>
<div class="mc_vals"><div class="mc_v"><span class="mc_num">61.4</span></div><div class="mc_v tgt"><span class="mc_num">62.3</span><span class="mc_sub">Goal</span></div></div>
<div class="mc_bar"><div class="mc_fill" style="width:79%"></div></div>
<div class="mc_goal_desc">Monthly target: +1.5% = 62.3 mph</div>
<div class="mc_desc">Avg exit speed · Range: 44–54–68</div></div><div class="mc"><div class="mc_top"><span class="mc_lbl">Peak EV</span><span class="mc_unit">mph</span></div>
<div class="mc_vals"><div class="mc_v"><span class="mc_num">76.5</span></div><div class="mc_v tgt"><span class="mc_num">77.6</span><span class="mc_sub">Goal</span></div></div>
<div class="mc_bar"><div class="mc_fill" style="width:95%"></div></div>
<div class="mc_goal_desc">Monthly target: 77.6 mph</div>
<div class="mc_desc">Hardest-hit ball speed</div></div><div class="mc"><div class="mc_top"><span class="mc_lbl">Hard Hit %</span><span class="mc_unit">%</span></div>
<div class="mc_vals"><div class="mc_v"><span class="mc_num">32.0</span></div><div class="mc_v tgt"><span class="mc_num">32.5</span><span class="mc_sub">Goal</span></div></div>
<div class="mc_bar"><div class="mc_fill" style="width:100%"></div></div>
<div class="mc_goal_desc">Monthly target: 32.5%</div>
<div class="mc_desc">Batted balls ≥ 48 mph</div></div><div class="mc"><div class="mc_top"><span class="mc_lbl">Barrel %</span><span class="mc_unit">%</span></div>
<div class="mc_vals"><div class="mc_v"><span class="mc_num">8.4</span></div><div class="mc_v tgt"><span class="mc_num">8.5</span><span class="mc_sub">Goal</span></div></div>
<div class="mc_bar"><div class="mc_fill" style="width:85%"></div></div>
<div class="mc_goal_desc">Monthly target: 8.5%</div>
<div class="mc_desc">Centered contact rate</div></div><div class="mc"><div class="mc_top"><span class="mc_lbl">Avg Distance</span><span class="mc_unit">ft</span></div>
<div class="mc_vals"><div class="mc_v"><span class="mc_num">149.6</span></div><div class="mc_v tgt"><span class="mc_num">151.8</span><span class="mc_sub">Goal</span></div></div>
<div class="mc_bar"><div class="mc_fill" style="width:100%"></div></div>
<div class="mc_goal_desc">Monthly target: 151.8 ft</div>
<div class="mc_desc">Range: 55–75</div></div><div class="mc"><div class="mc_top"><span class="mc_lbl">Max Distance</span><span class="mc_unit">ft</span></div>
<div class="mc_vals"><div class="mc_v"><span class="mc_num">251.3</span></div><div class="mc_v tgt"><span class="mc_num">255.1</span><span class="mc_sub">Goal</span></div></div>
<div class="mc_bar"><div class="mc_fill" style="width:100%"></div></div>
<div class="mc_goal_desc">Monthly target: 255.1 ft</div>
<div class="mc_desc">Farthest batted ball</div></div></div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">Benchmark Position (12U)</div><div class="pct"><div class="pr"><span class="pr_lbl">Exit Velo</span><span class="pr_bar"><span class="pr_fill" style="width:75%"></span></span><span class="pr_val">75%</span></div>
<div class="pr"><span class="pr_lbl">Hard Hit</span><span class="pr_bar"><span class="pr_fill" style="width:80%"></span></span><span class="pr_val">80%</span></div>
<div class="pr"><span class="pr_lbl">Barrel</span><span class="pr_bar"><span class="pr_fill" style="width:67%"></span></span><span class="pr_val">67%</span></div>
<div class="pr"><span class="pr_lbl">Distance</span><span class="pr_bar"><span class="pr_fill" style="width:99%"></span></span><span class="pr_val">99%</span></div></div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">Coach's Notes</div><div class="recs"><ol><li>🎯 Paxton Wilson's peak exit velo is 76.5 mph right now. At a 1-2% monthly gain, that's 78.8 mph in 2 months. Every session adds MPH!</li><li>🔫 Barrel rate at 8.4% — work on centering the ball on the barrel. More centered contact = more carry and distance.</li><li>💪 Hard-hit rate of 32.0% shows great contact quality. Keep squaring up the barrel!</li><li>🏆 42 sessions logged at The Cage — that's real dedication! Every rep builds the athlete you're becoming. See you at the next cage session!</li></ol></div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">Monthly Progress</div><div class="recs" style="padding:10px;">
