<div style="font-size:9px;color:#888888;opacity:0.5;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;">Monthly averages · Max EV &amp; Avg EV (mph) · dashed = trend · Last 13 months</div>
</div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">Hard Hit %</div><div class="recs" style="padding:10px;">
<img src="data:image/png;base64," style="width:100%;border-radius:6px;display:block;">
<div style="font-size:9px;color:#888888;opacity:0.5;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;">Monthly Hard Hit % · per-session 92% of rolling max (30 sessions back) · dashed = trend · Last 13 months</div>
</div></div>
<div class="ft">Earn It Academy · The Cage · Personal progress goals (1.5% monthly) · Sep 25, 2026</div>
</body></html>